          "text": "“Nine Yesu ne utumine malaika wandi ku kwisa sokolola ifi fintu ku nkunta shonse. Ine ndi wa mu lupwa lwakwa Davidi, kabili nine lutanda ulwabekesha ulwa lucelo.”",
          "type": "text",
